          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On April 9, 2010, around 10:08 PM, a witness observed the very fast and high-altitude passage O-E of an object with a decreasing intensity red light as it moved away. The object was quickly obscured by the landscape. The witness did not respond to the Geipan's repeated requests for additional information. Without a gendarmerie report or additional information, any investigation is impossible. The case is classified C due to a lack of information.",
